<view class="login"><view class="logo">叶</view><view class="brand">叶芝英语</view><view class="tagline">K12 英语培训 · 学情一站式查看</view><view class="login-card"><view class="title center">家长登录</view><view class="sub center">首次进入需授权手机号，用于关联已报名学员</view><button wx:if="{{!hasSession}}" class="wechat" bindtap="wechatLogin" loading="{{busy}}">微信授权登录</button><button wx:if="{{showPhone}}" class="wechat" open-type="getPhoneNumber" bindgetphonenumber="phone" loading="{{busy}}">授权手机号并关联学员</button><button wx:if="{{hasSession}}" class="ghost space" bindtap="logout">退出当前账号</button><view class="consent"><checkbox checked="{{consent}}" color="#FF7A00" bindtap="toggleConsent"/>已阅读并同意</view><view class="row center"><text bindtap="go" data-page="content" data-kind="agreement">《用户协议》</text><text bindtap="go" data-page="content" data-kind="privacy">《隐私政策》</text></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view></view><view class="login-foot">若登录后未关联到学员，请联系机构核对报名预留手机号</view><view wx:if="{{testMode}}" class="dev-card"><view class="title">隔离开发环境 · 测试身份</view><view class="sub">以下入口仅验证业务流程，不是真实微信登录。请勿上传真实学生资料。</view><button class="ghost" bindtap="developmentLogin" data-persona="parent-a">测试家长 A（两名学员）</button><button class="ghost" bindtap="developmentLogin" data-persona="parent-b">测试家长 B（权限隔离）</button><button class="ghost" bindtap="developmentLogin" data-persona="unlinked">测试未关联家长</button></view></view>